WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:03.629
My life lesson is that resiliency pays off.

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:07.779
My mother’s dreams for me was to live an
easier life than hers.

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:10.620
She did not want me to struggle and fight
as much as she did.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:16.200
That’s why she always reminded me to keep
my education first.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.929
By December of my first semester of university,
my mom had passed away from cancer.

00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:24.960
If my mother had had life insurance, things
would have been a lot easier for both me and

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.300
my siblings.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.579
I would have been able to go to school without
thinking of money so much and funeral costs

00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:31.829
would have been paid for.

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:35.910
When I found the Manulife Life Lessons Scholarship,
I was in shock.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:41.160
I thought this is exactly my life and I did
not understand or realize that there were

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.550
other people who went through what I went
through.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.360
It felt like someone wanted to hear my story
for the first time.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:50.190
The process of applying to the Manulife Life
Lessons Scholarship was easy.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.620
The difficult part was thinking about all
the life lessons I’ve had to learn thus

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.620
far.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:58.780
Before I had this scholarship, I was working
3 jobs and had 16-hour long days with school

00:00:58.780 --> 00:00:59.780
and work.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.560
Since I got the scholarship, I’ve been able
to focus more on school, I haven’t had to

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:09.799
work as much, and I’ve been able to get
involved in the community a lot more.

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:13.880
My life lesson is resiliency pays off because
there were many times I wanted to quit and

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:16.840
give up but it was resiliency that kept me
motivated.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.090
I am very much my mother’s daughter.

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.409
She never gave up and neither will I.

00:01:21.409 --> 00:01:25.700
To someone thinking of applying to the Manulife
Life Lessons Scholarship, my advice is to

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.700
just do it.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.899
It will change your life as much as it’s
changed mine.

